# Stub interfaces file for PDM in Docker.
# This file is intentionally minimal — Docker manages the container's
# networking, and edits made via the PDM Network panel are NOT applied
# (there is no ifupdown / ifreload service running). The PDM panel will
# display only the loopback interface here; the real interface (eth0) is
# created by Docker at runtime.

auto lo
iface lo inet loopback
